*   **Charitable Donation:** Because you will likely take the standard deduction, the $1,100 donation to the United Way will not provide an additional tax benefit for 2024.

### 3. How to Handle the Home Office?
Because you have self-employment income (1099/freelance), you can deduct your home office against your web design income. You have two choices:
